Your only task is to produce five valid compact rating arrays.

Return a single compact JSON object with exactly these properties: "0", "1", "2", "3", "4".
Each property must be a flat array containing exactly 54 integers.
The integers alternate score then confidence-decile for 27 categories.
Scores are 0-100. Confidence deciles are 0-10 and represent confidence divided by ten.
The final two integers are the Overall score and Overall confidence decile.
Do not return starId, ratings, index, statementId, nested objects, strings, decimals, commentary, or markdown.
Do not use category positions 0 through 26 as scores.
Keep the JSON compact and preferably on one line.
